## Phased Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 1: Core Setup & State Infrastructure (`docs/phases/phase-01-core-setup/`)
- Establish project toolchain, test runner configuration, and styling tokens.
- Implement base reactive state management and configuration modules.

### Phase 2: Data Models & Persistence Layer (`docs/phases/phase-02-data-and-persistence/`)
- Implement database schemas, ORM models, or encrypted local storage repositories.
- Validate data persistence and security guardrails.

### Phase 3: Domain Logic & Services Engine (`docs/phases/phase-03-domain-logic-services/`)
- Implement pure domain service calculation modules and business workflows.
- Scaffold unit tests to ensure 100% calculation accuracy.

### Phase 4: Component Views & User Flows (`docs/phases/phase-04-components-and-ui/`)
- Build reactive user interface components, views, and interactive forms.
- Connect UI elements to business services and storage composables.

### Phase 5: Localization & Release Automation (`docs/phases/phase-05-i18n-and-release/`)
- Implement reactive i18n localization dictionaries (`en-US`, `pt-BR`).
- Configure export/import functionality and release automation guidelines.
